{"id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dep-pred-semantics.md","title":"df-dependent-predicate-semantics","display":"df-dependent-predicate-semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dep-pred-semantics","aliases":["16-df-dep-pred-semantics","Dependent predicate semantics","16-dep-pred-semantics"],"display":"df-dependent-predicate-semantics","depends_on":["[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Definition 11.2.1, p. 654 (PDF 674); Definition 9.3.5, pp. 540–541 (PDF 560–561)","revision_date":"2026-10-15","review_status":"resolved-source-correspondence","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J06","review_date":"2026-10-15","previous_review_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dep-pred-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dep-pred-semantics</span><span>Dependent predicate semantics</span><span>16-dep-pred-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-predicate-semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 11.2.1, p. 654 (PDF 674); Definition 9.3.5, pp. 540–541 (PDF 560–561)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-source-correspondence"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J06"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"previous_review_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。</li>\n<li>下文局部构造的自由参数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>；同名变量在显式量词中重新绑定。</li>\n<li>沿用理解记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\">\\(\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi f=(\\{f\\},pf)\">\\(\\chi f=(\\{f\\},pf)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_X=\\pi_X^*X\">\\(W_X=\\pi_X^*X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_X:W_X\\to X\">\\(\\kappa_X:W_X\\to X\\)</span> 是选定的笛卡尔提升，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pW_X=\\{X\\}\">\\(pW_X=\\{X\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\kappa_X=\\pi_X\">\\(p\\kappa_X=\\pi_X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{W_X},\\{\\kappa_X\\}:\\{W_X\\}\\rightrightarrows\\{X\\}\">\\(\\pi_{W_X},\\{\\kappa_X\\}:\\{W_X\\}\\rightrightarrows\\{X\\}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> 沿自身拉回的两投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 在以下公式中表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的重索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\">\\(\\leq_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_I\">\\(\\simeq_I\\)</span> 是预序纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_I\">\\(\\mathcal D_I\\)</span> 中的可达关系与双向可达关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\)</span> 表示上述拉回中由两分量唯一确定的箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_q\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_q\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ae1a27a060629395\" href=\"?note=ae1a27a060629395\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts\">16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D\">\\(G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D\\)</span> 是候选高阶数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelQuant}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelQuant}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPredSem}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_p,\\mathsf{Pred}_q,\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_p,\\mathsf{Pred}_q,\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}\\)</span> 由下文定义；量词族的箭头表示函子，存在量词同时约束其类型和后续所有条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}},\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}\\rangle:\n\\{X\\}\\longrightarrow\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}\\delta_X&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}=\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}\\delta_X.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}},\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}\\rangle:\n\\{X\\}\\longrightarrow\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}\\delta_X&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}=\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}\\delta_X.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\nb_f&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\}\\rangle:\n\\{W_Y\\}\\to\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}b_f&amp;=\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\\\\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}b_f&amp;=\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\},\\\\\nb_f\\delta_Y&amp;=\\delta_X\\{f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\nb_f&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\}\\rangle:\n\\{W_Y\\}\\to\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}b_f&amp;=\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\\\\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}b_f&amp;=\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\},\\\\\nb_f\\delta_Y&amp;=\\delta_X\\{f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X,\\mathsf{Eq}_X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E})\\bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{pX}\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal D_{pX})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl[(\\Sigma_XA\\leq_{pX}B\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\pi_X^*B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\pi_X^*B\\leq_{\\{X\\}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\leq_{pX}\\Pi_XA)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall C\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\leq_{\\{W_X\\}}C\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\delta_X^*C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n\\bigl((pf)^*\\Sigma_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Sigma_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(pf)^*\\Pi_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Pi_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land b_f^*\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\simeq_{\\{W_Y\\}}\n\\mathsf{Eq}_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X,\\mathsf{Eq}_X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E})\\bigl[{}&amp;\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{pX}\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal D_{pX})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl[(\\Sigma_XA\\leq_{pX}B\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\pi_X^*B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\pi_X^*B\\leq_{\\{X\\}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\leq_{pX}\\Pi_XA)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall C\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\leq_{\\{W_X\\}}C\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\delta_X^*C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n\\bigl((pf)^*\\Sigma_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Sigma_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(pf)^*\\Pi_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Pi_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land b_f^*\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\simeq_{\\{W_Y\\}}\n\\mathsf{Eq}_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(I,p\\Omega))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\land qG=\\{\\Omega\\}\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(I,p\\Omega))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\land qG=\\{\\Omega\\}\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_p(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E_I),\n&amp;I&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pred}_q(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_I),\n&amp;I&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}),\n&amp;X&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_p(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E_I),\n&amp;I&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pred}_q(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_I),\n&amp;I&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}),\n&amp;X&amp;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本页展开 Definition 11.2.1 的四项条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 共用语境基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>；类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的谓词位于扩张语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X\\}\">\\(\\{X\\}\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>-纤维。旧稿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的纤维化塔并非这里的 DPL 结构。</li>\n<li>三组序关系等价式分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_X\\dashv\\pi_X^*\\dashv\\Pi_X\">\\(\\Sigma_X\\dashv\\pi_X^*\\dashv\\Pi_X\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\dashv\\delta_X^*\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\dashv\\delta_X^*\\)</span> 在预序纤维中的完整伴随条件；后面三式是 Definition 9.3.5 的 Beck–Chevalley 条件。这里只要求理解投影、理解对角及由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-笛卡尔箭头诱导的换基，不额外要求任意基箭头都有左右伴随。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)\\)</span> 已含纤维有限积和重索引保持性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)\\)</span> 加入稳定的底对象与析取，合起来得到原书的纤维双笛卡尔闭预序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Omega\">\\(p\\Omega\\)</span> 为终对象表达“闭类型”；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\Omega\\}\\)</span> 上且是普通泛对象，不能换成未附指定分裂的严格泛对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X\">\\(\\delta_X\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_f\">\\(b_f\\)</span> 的存在唯一性由理解函子把笛卡尔提升送到拉回方块得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_f\">\\(b_f\\)</span> 的两分量满足相同的复合等式，故拉回泛性质给出其定义；最后的对角交换式也由同一泛性质推出。对预序范畴，逐对象双向可达等价于相应规范 mate 可逆。</li>\n<li>历史问题 J06 于 2026-10-07 标为 P1；2026-10-15 已就本定义完成来源对应和接口重建。兼容入口同步为五参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\)</span>。这不声明项模型、可靠性或完备性已经构造完成，也不把可选的 dependent subset/quotient types 纳入本定义。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 11.2.1, printed p. 654 / PDF 第 674 页；Definition 9.3.5, printed pp. 540–541 / PDF 第 560–561 页。上述三个 PDF 页面已逐项读文并视觉核对图形及源靶。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts","status":"resolved","id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B$ 是带提升选择的纤维化；$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 满足 $\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，见 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u^*$ 在以下公式中表示 $q$ 的重索引；$\\leq_I$、$\\simeq_I$ 是预序纤维 $\\mathcal D_I$ 中的可达关系与双向可达关系，见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。$\\langle a,b\\rangle$ 表示上述拉回中由两分量唯一确定的箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$、$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$、$\\mathrm{Generic}_q$ 分别采用 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-f