d":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$、$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$、$\\mathrm{Generic}_q$ 分别采用 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi f=(\\{f\\},pf)","display":false},{"tex":"W_X=\\pi_X^*X","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_X:W_X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"pW_X=\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\kappa_X=\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{W_X},\\{\\kappa_X\\}:\\{W_X\\}\\rightrightarrows\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibPre}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelQuant}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_p,\\mathsf{Pred}_q,\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_X&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}},\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}\\rangle:\n\\{X\\}\\longrightarrow\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}\\delta_X&=\\operatorname{id}_{\\{X\\}}=\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}\\delta_X.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\quad\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\nb_f&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\}\\rangle:\n\\{W_Y\\}\\to\\{W_X\\},\\\\\n\\pi_{W_X}b_f&=\\{f\\}\\pi_{W_Y},\\\\\n\\{\\kappa_X\\}b_f&=\\{f\\}\\{\\kappa_Y\\},\\\\\nb_f\\delta_Y&=\\delta_X\\{f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X,\\mathsf{Eq}_X)_{X\\in\\mathcal E})\\bigl[{}&\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)\\\n\\Sigma_X,\\Pi_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{pX}\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathsf{Eq}_X:\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal D_{pX})\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl[(\\Sigma_XA\\leq_{pX}B\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\pi_X^*B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\pi_X^*B\\leq_{\\{X\\}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\leq_{pX}\\Pi_XA)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n(\\forall C\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{W_X\\}})\\\\\n&\\quad(\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\leq_{\\{W_X\\}}C\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\leq_{\\{X\\}}\\delta_X^*C)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\n\\bigl((pf)^*\\Sigma_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Sigma_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(pf)^*\\Pi_XA\\simeq_{pY}\\Pi_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land b_f^*\\mathsf{Eq}_XA\\simeq_{\\{W_Y\\}}\n\\mathsf{Eq}_Y\\{f\\}^*A\\bigr)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DepPredSem}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)\n\\land\\mathrm{RelQuant}(p,\\chi;q)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(I,p\\Omega))\\ h=h\\\\\n&\\land qG=\\{\\Omega\\}\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_q(G).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_p(I)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E_I),\n&I&\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pred}_q(I)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_I),\n&I&\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PredOn}_{\\chi,q}(X)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}}),\n&X&\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_X\\dashv\\pi_X^*\\dashv\\Pi_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_X\\dashv\\delta_X^*","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\Omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"b_f","display":false},{"tex":"b_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPredSem}_{df}(p,\\chi,q,\\Omega,G)","display":false}],"bytes":6596,"backlinks":[{"id":"aa06e4e5c3d08a39","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}$、$\\mathrm{DepPredSem}$ 及完整结构参数采用 [[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]] 的 Hypothesis 与 Assertion。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]、[[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]、[[16-df-dep-pred-semantics]]、[[16-df-dep-pred-semantics-compat]]。DPL 两条纤维化共用语境基底；闭类型、泛对象、相对量词和相等均显式携带。"}],"outgoing":["3015a5a145e2e498","0ba8f021ca287877","ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","fe079ae5e294c97a","ae1a27a060629395","f600e95377e8cbf9","427be4d627513590"]}